67	 * Resolves platform + directory: prompts via clack select()/text() when omitted on a TTY
68	 * (not --yes); throws ScaffoldCliError with a clear, localized message when a required
69	 * value is missing non-interactively.
70	 *
71	 * All prompt copy (message/placeholder/option labels) is looked up via `t`.
72	 *
73	 * @param options - Resolution options
